Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.63,F-roco,,0,0,70,,木实 不愧是{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Leader
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.63,F-roco,,0,0,70,,{\fscx60\fscy60\bord3.8\pos(1103,945)}领袖
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.97,0:13:34.06,A-bba,,0,0,70,,我啊
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.86,A-bba,,0,0,70,,被制作人问道「要当偶像吗」的时候
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.54,0:13:41.58,A-bba,,0,0,70,,我想到 我是否也能改变自己呢
