Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.90,0:14:34.42,F-roco,,0,0,70,,{\fscx60\fscy60\bord3.8\pos(1130,945)}画作
Dialogue: 9,0:14:34.42,0:14:38.22,F-roco,,0,0,70,,不{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Try{\fscx50} {\fscx100}几次 Image{\fscx50} {\fscx100}是不会成形的
