Dialogue: 9,0:19:49.56,0:19:52.92,P-arisa,,0,0,70,,轮到一直在为团队努力的人登场了呢
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.88,0:19:56.68,A-bba,,0,0,70,,那么 做好觉悟吧
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.68,0:19:58.09,P-奈绪,,0,0,70,,呃啊啊{\fscx50} {\fscx100}(;`{\fscx50} {\fscx100}皿{\fscx50} {\fscx100}´)
Dialogue: 9,0:19:58.09,0:19:59.97,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,谢谢你 能来帮我
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.44,0:20:01.60,A-bba,,0,0,70,,我才是
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.04,0:20:04.40,其它,,0,0,70,,加油 偶像侦探
Dialogue: 9,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.49,其它,,0,0,70,,童星偶像也加油
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.36,A-bba,,0,0,70,,不对 是性感侦探
Dialogue: 9,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.32,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,有姐姐在的话就有百倍的力量了呢
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.85,0:20:18.17,A-bba,,0,0,70,,嗯 不管逃跑多少次
Dialogue: 9,0:20:18.17,0:20:20.24,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,也会将你捉拿归案
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.89,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,快 把钻石还回来吧
Dialogue: 9,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.62,P-奈绪,,0,0,70,,说…说什么鬼话
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.77,0:20:29.57,A-bba,,0,0,70,,啊 那里有洞小心点
Dialogue: 9,0:20:29.57,0:20:32.40,P-奈绪,,0,0,70,,中 谢谢 你人还怪好的勒
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.96,0:20:35.15,P-奈绪,,0,0,70,,嘛玩意儿啊
Dialogue: 9,0:20:35.15,0:20:36.32,A-bba,,0,0,70,,做到了
Dialogue: 9,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.76,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,看这个
Dialogue: 9,0:20:39.32,0:20:41.33,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,任务完成
Dialogue: 9,0:20:53.58,0:20:55.22,A-bba,,0,0,70,,任务完成
Dialogue: 9,0:20:55.82,0:20:57.02,P-未来,,0,0,70,,哇
Dialogue: 9,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.54,A-翼,,0,0,70,,好有趣
Dialogue: 9,0:20:58.54,0:21:02.50,F-静香,,0,0,70,,两边的出道活动都在网上获得了极高的讨论度呢
Dialogue: 9,0:21:02.94,0:21:05.27,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,大家 有努力过了呢
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.27,0:21:07.03,P-奈绪,,0,0,70,,好评如潮勒
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.87,P-奈绪,,0,0,70,,你没能亲眼看到真是太可惜了
Dialogue: 9,0:21:09.87,0:21:12.54,P-arisa,,0,0,70,,要回去后看看{\fscx50} {\fscx100}5th{\fscx50} {\fscx100}的活动录像吗
Dialogue: 9,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.64,A-女儿,,0,0,70,,好 大家一起看吧
Dialogue: 9,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.44,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,桃子这次的表现很亮眼呢
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.44,0:21:22.28,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 9,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.56,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,这种程度很正常吧
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.56,0:21:28.16,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,但下次我想给你看看更厉害的舞台
Dialogue: 9,0:21:28.68,0:21:30.76,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,以后视线可不准移开我
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.27,F-桃子,,0,0,70,,不准眨眼睛哦
Dialogue: 9,0:21:32.27,0:21:33.20,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,好啊
Dialogue: 9,0:21:39.71,0:21:40.66,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,木实姐
Dialogue: 9,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.61,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,你在这里啊
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.10,0:21:46.97,A-bba,,0,0,70,,嗯 想吹吹风
Dialogue: 9,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.74,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,今天真是谢谢你了
Dialogue: 9,0:21:50.47,0:21:52.73,A-bba,,0,0,70,,该说谢谢的应该是我才对
Dialogue: 9,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.02,S-赤P源P,,0,0,70,,诶！？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.73,0:21:55.91,A-bba,,0,0,70,,制作人
Dialogue: 9,0:21:57.23,0:21:59.77,A-bba,,0,0,70,,让我成为偶像
Dialogue: 9,0:21:59.77,0:22:01.12,A-bba,,0,0,70,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 9,0:23:32.00,0:23:35.32,P-阁下,,0,0,70,,我们{\fscx50} {\fscx100}765PRO ALLSTARS{\fscx50} {\fscx100}正在巡演中
Dialogue: 9,0:23:35.32,0:23:38.48,F-72,,0,0,70,,分成了小组 环绕全国进行巡演呢
Dialogue: 9,0:23:38.48,0:23:40.66,A-yayoi,,0,0,70,,今天是在横滨{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Live{\fscx50} {\fscx100}哦
Dialogue: 9,0:23:40.66,0:23:42.00,A-miki,,0,0,70,,诶 梓呢
Dialogue: 9,0:23:42.00,0:23:43.68,F-贵音,,0,0,70,,已经是集合时间了
Dialogue: 9,0:23:43.68,0:23:45.20,P-雪步,,0,0,70,,还没来呢
Dialogue: 9,0:23:45.20,0:23:47.04,P-响,,0,0,70,,难道说是
Dialogue: 9,0:23:47.04,0:23:48.68,P-真哥,,0,0,70,,嗯 大概是完蛋了
Dialogue: 9,0:23:48.68,0:23:50.96,F-伊织,,0,0,70,,梓 你在吗？现在在哪里
Dialogue: 9,0:23:50.96,0:23:52.76,A-梓,,0,0,70,,嗯 现在啊
Dialogue: 9,0:23:52.76,0:23:53.72,A-亚美真美,,0,0,70,,心跳心跳
Dialogue: 9,0:23:53.72,0:23:54.60,A-梓,,0,0,70,,在东京呢
Dialogue: 9,0:23:54.60,0:23:55.56,F-律子,,0,0,70,,好耶 很近
Dialogue: 9,0:23:55.56,0:23:57.48,A-梓,,0,0,70,,的八丈岛
Dialogue: 9,0:23:57.48,0:23:59.64,其它,,0,0,70,,八丈岛！？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:01.05,0:00:05.41,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それから リハでわからないことがあったらその場で確認すること
Dialogue: 8,0:00:05.41,0:00:06.42,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}わかった？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:06.42,0:00:08.90,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}うん すぐ聞くようにするね！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.35,P-未来,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ おはよう！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:10.70,0:00:11.96,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おはよう！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:12.74,0:00:16.20,A-翼,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃんも育ちゃんもこれから デビューイベントだよね？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:16.20,0:00:20.42,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}うん！ 桃子はチームフォースで 育はチームフィフス
Dialogue: 8,0:00:21.02,0:00:23.24,F-静香,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}２か所で同時にやるんですよね？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:23.24,0:00:25.88,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ああ 話題になりやすいようにな
Dialogue: 8,0:00:25.88,0:00:28.92,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お客さんの前でやるのも この２チームが初めてだ
Dialogue: 8,0:00:29.35,0:00:34.52,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今ね 現場で どうすればいいか 桃子ちゃんに教えてもらってたんだよ
Dialogue: 8,0:00:34.52,0:00:35.96,P-未来,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}へぇ！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.66,F-静香,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}子役のときからの経験があるものね
Dialogue: 8,0:00:38.66,0:00:40.44,P-未来,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どんなこと教えてあげたの？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:41.06,0:00:45.36,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}別に 桃子はプロとして当たり前のことを言っただけだよ
Dialogue: 8,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.58,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}じゃあ そろそろ出発だ
Dialogue: 8,0:00:47.58,0:00:48.84,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}は～い
Dialogue: 8,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.04,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}行ってくるね！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.98,P-未来,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}うん 応援してるね！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:51.98,0:00:53.30,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ありがとう！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:53.30,0:00:55.02,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃんも頑張ってね！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:55.02,0:00:58.34,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}もちろん！ やるからには絶対 成功させるよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:59.02,0:01:02.22,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}チームサードのみんな すてきですわね
Dialogue: 8,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.50,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}もし 私が行っていたら
Dialogue: 8,0:01:04.50,0:01:08.66,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あふれるセクシーが大変なことになっていたかもしれないわね
Dialogue: 8,0:01:08.66,0:01:11.74,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}千鶴の水着も人気 出そうやなぁ
Dialogue: 8,0:01:11.74,0:01:14.74,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ま… まあ あふれるセレブリティで
Dialogue: 8,0:01:14.74,0:01:17.54,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}大変なことになるかもしれませんわね
Dialogue: 8,0:01:17.54,0:01:20.82,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}オーホッホッホ… ゴホッ ゴホッ！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.82,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おはよう
Dialogue: 8,0:01:20.82,0:01:21.56,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おはよう
Dialogue: 8,0:01:22.28,0:01:23.92,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これで そろったわね
Dialogue: 8,0:01:25.40,0:01:29.26,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それじゃ チームフォース 朝の点呼をしちゃうわよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:29.26,0:01:30.28,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃん！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.60,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}よろしくお願いします
Dialogue: 8,0:01:31.60,0:01:33.32,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おっ なんかプロっぽい
Dialogue: 8,0:01:34.38,0:01:35.40,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}亜利沙ちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.49,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ はい！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:36.49,0:01:37.40,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}奈緒ちゃん！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:37.40,0:01:38.41,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はいは～い！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:38.60,0:01:39.54,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ロコちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:01:41.22,0:01:43.48,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}呼ばれていますわよ コロちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:01:43.48,0:01:44.88,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ はい！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.48,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも コロじゃなくて ロコです
Dialogue: 8,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.08,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}で 千鶴ちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:01:49.08,0:01:49.98,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.34,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}皆さん よろしくお願いいたしますわ
Dialogue: 8,0:01:52.74,0:01:54.90,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ちゃんと全員いるわね
Dialogue: 8,0:01:54.90,0:01:57.52,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}リーダー 朝から張り切ってますねぇ
Dialogue: 8,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.70,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}当然よ だって…
Dialogue: 8,0:01:59.70,0:02:00.64,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさん
Dialogue: 8,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.48,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今日はリーダー兼引率 よろしくお願いします
Dialogue: 8,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.08,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ええ こっちは任せて
Dialogue: 8,0:02:06.08,0:02:09.70,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}プロデューサーはフィフスについていってあげたほうが いいもの
Dialogue: 8,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.22,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}大人がいないしね
Dialogue: 8,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.74,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 8,0:02:13.74,0:02:17.80,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}段取りは現場のスタッフさんたちと しっかり打ち合わせしてあります
Dialogue: 8,0:02:17.80,0:02:20.00,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}けど 何かあったら すぐ俺に…
Dialogue: 8,0:02:19.52,0:02:21.16,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いいから いいから
Dialogue: 8,0:02:21.16,0:02:22.76,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}とにかく心配しないで
Dialogue: 8,0:02:22.76,0:02:25.00,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみお姉さんに任せなさい
Dialogue: 8,0:02:26.46,0:02:27.90,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}よろしくお願いします
Dialogue: 8,0:02:28.82,0:02:32.22,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それじゃ チームフォース 出発するわよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.35,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私らフォースもバシッとキメんとな！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:07.62,0:04:11.66,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ファースト セカンド サードって あんだけ盛り上がったんやから
Dialogue: 8,0:04:11.66,0:04:15.03,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ロコはもう パッションがエクスプロージョンしてます！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.82,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おぉ めっちゃしとるな！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:18.10,0:04:20.74,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私たちも しっかり続かないとね
Dialogue: 8,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.00,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうですわね
Dialogue: 8,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.90,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今までで いっちばん盛り上げたるで！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:26.24,0:04:28.74,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あ… あの 桃子ちゃん先輩！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:28.74,0:04:29.29,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:04:29.29,0:04:31.79,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}なんや ちゃん先輩って
Dialogue: 8,0:04:31.96,0:04:34.14,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}芸能界の先輩ですから
Dialogue: 8,0:04:34.14,0:04:36.50,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}亜利沙 一緒のチームになれたので
Dialogue: 8,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.68,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃん先輩の出ていたドラマを見ちゃいました
Dialogue: 8,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.20,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いっぱいあるんですね！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:41.46,0:04:44.12,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}当然だよ 桃子は女優だもん
Dialogue: 8,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.30,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}特に一気見しちゃったのがこれです！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.44,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}『子役探偵 桃子ちゃん』
Dialogue: 8,0:04:48.44,0:04:50.10,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}大人気だったんですよね！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.30,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あぁ 私も知ってるわ
Dialogue: 8,0:04:53.68,0:04:57.52,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}子役である桃子ちゃんがそのまま本人役を演じつつ
Dialogue: 8,0:04:57.52,0:05:00.32,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}裏稼業として探偵をやっているという
Dialogue: 8,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.56,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}現実と地続きの設定がとってもアツいんです！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:03.56,0:05:05.08,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それに 決めゼリフも！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.34,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}な… なんだ お前は
Dialogue: 8,0:05:07.34,0:05:08.87,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ただの子役のくせに！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.58,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子は子役
Dialogue: 8,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.90,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも ただの子役じゃない！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:12.90,0:05:14.09,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}子役探偵
Dialogue: 8,0:05:14.98,0:05:15.94,F-桃子,,0,1200,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.30,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あれ最高です！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.14,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}公開生放送スペシャルも
Dialogue: 8,0:05:20.14,0:05:23.98,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}リアルタイムで見られればどんなに よかったか クーッ！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:31.20,0:05:32.68,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃん先輩？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.58,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ… なに？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.62,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どうかしたんですか？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:37.38,0:05:40.84,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}別に 桃子いろんな お仕事したから
Dialogue: 8,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.57,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}細かいこと覚えてないの
Dialogue: 8,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.84,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ 最初は事務員として？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:46.84,0:05:52.12,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}うん 私 大学を出て２年くらい会社に勤めてたんだけどね
Dialogue: 8,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.76,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}急につぶれちゃって
Dialogue: 8,0:05:53.76,0:05:56.94,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まぁ… 失業保険は いただきましたの？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.80,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そ… そうね
Dialogue: 8,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.40,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}千鶴ちゃん セレブなのに詳しいのね
Dialogue: 8,0:06:01.40,0:06:04.56,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ええ うちのお客さん… ではなく
Dialogue: 8,0:06:04.56,0:06:08.32,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}社交界の方にもいろいろありますの オホホホ
Dialogue: 8,0:06:08.86,0:06:11.64,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それより そのあとはどうなりましたの？
Dialogue: 8,0:06:11.92,0:06:14.86,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}次の仕事を探してるときに見つけたのが
Dialogue: 8,0:06:14.86,0:06:16.86,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}765プロの事務職だったの
Dialogue: 8,0:06:17.22,0:06:19.57,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それで面接を受けにいったとき
Dialogue: 8,0:06:20.10,0:06:23.10,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}アイドルのオーディションにきたって勘違いされて
Dialogue: 8,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.06,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}その場で スカウトされたのよ
Dialogue: 8,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.18,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうでしたの
Dialogue: 8,0:06:28.02,0:06:30.54,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まさに運命的勘違い
Dialogue: 8,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.04,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そのように人生が変わることって
Dialogue: 8,0:06:33.04,0:06:34.50,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ありますわよね
Dialogue: 8,0:06:36.14,0:06:37.29,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうね！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:38.58,0:06:41.06,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}さ～て アトラクションに負けんよう
Dialogue: 8,0:06:41.06,0:06:44.34,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}トークもライブも 思いっきり盛り上げんとな！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.82,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}２回まわしの２回とも！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:46.82,0:06:49.43,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}当たり前だよ 桃子たち プロだもん
Dialogue: 8,0:06:49.86,0:06:53.35,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今日のステージは アイドルイベントの聖地と言われてるんです！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.94,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ここね
Dialogue: 8,0:06:54.94,0:06:56.22,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}センターですね！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:56.22,0:07:00.10,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい！通りかかる人たちにも見てもらえる場所ですよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:00.10,0:07:03.66,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}きっと ゴージャスなステージに違いありませんわね！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:05.58,0:07:06.34,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:07.12,0:07:09.34,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}え～っ!?
Dialogue: 8,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.26,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ここ 私たちのステージやんな？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.66,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どういうこと？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:13.66,0:07:15.18,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おはようございます
Dialogue: 8,0:07:15.18,0:07:16.86,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おはようございます
Dialogue: 8,0:07:16.86,0:07:17.80,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これって…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:17.80,0:07:21.58,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ステージ下を走る水道管が 破裂してしまって
Dialogue: 8,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.70,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ!?
Dialogue: 8,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.86,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それで こちらが代わりのステージなのですが…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.98,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}レトロテイストですね
Dialogue: 8,0:07:37.74,0:07:39.12,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}気ぃつけな
Dialogue: 8,0:07:39.12,0:07:41.32,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ふだんは もう使っていないんですが
Dialogue: 8,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.38,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}音響は生きていますので
Dialogue: 8,0:07:44.90,0:07:47.06,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}さっき俺にも連絡ありました
Dialogue: 8,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.50,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}だいぶ古いんですよね？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:48.94,0:07:50.58,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まぁ そうね
Dialogue: 8,0:07:50.58,0:07:53.45,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}段取りは そのままでいけるそうですが…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:53.72,0:07:56.10,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それなら どうにかなると思うわ
Dialogue: 8,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.12,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}プロデューサーは心配しないで
Dialogue: 8,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.66,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そっちはどう？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.94,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あぁ 今のところ順調…
Dialogue: 8,0:08:01.86,0:08:04.40,A-茜,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんな注目！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:04.40,0:08:09.06,A-茜,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}美少女アイドルが今からデビューしちゃうよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.76,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}…な感じはしています
Dialogue: 8,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.32,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}アクシデントはあったけど
Dialogue: 8,0:08:17.32,0:08:20.28,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今日まで やれるだけのことはやってきたんだもの
Dialogue: 8,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.52,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんなで お客さんを盛り上げましょう！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:22.74,0:08:24.80,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}せやな！ やっとデビューや！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.92,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}気合い入れていくで！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:26.92,0:08:27.68,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:27.68,0:08:30.40,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}現場にトラブルはつきものだからね
Dialogue: 8,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.92,其它,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それでは MILLIONSTARS チームフォースの皆さんです
Dialogue: 8,0:08:34.32,0:08:37.02,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}皆さん こんにちは！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:37.02,0:08:37.80,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.12,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これ
Dialogue: 8,0:08:44.12,0:08:46.04,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}開園してるん？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.22,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そりゃしてるわな！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:52.50,0:08:56.64,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}こ… この差し入れでも食べて 元気を出しませんこと？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:56.64,0:08:57.76,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}うぅ…
Dialogue: 8,0:08:58.16,0:08:59.89,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうですよね
Dialogue: 8,0:09:00.28,0:09:04.04,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まさか オーディエンスがあんなにミニマムだなんて
Dialogue: 8,0:09:04.04,0:09:07.00,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも 少しは来てくれてましたよ
Dialogue: 8,0:09:07.00,0:09:08.96,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}え～と 全部で…
Dialogue: 8,0:09:09.44,0:09:11.32,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}１ ２ ３…
Dialogue: 8,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.07,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}４ ５
Dialogue: 8,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.24,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}最後 ネコ入れたやろ
Dialogue: 8,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.33,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}は… はい
Dialogue: 8,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.48,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今までのデビューとは大違いだね
Dialogue: 8,0:09:21.86,0:09:25.90,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いちばんの問題は やはり ステージの場所ですわね
Dialogue: 8,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.26,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}人通りがまったくありませんから
Dialogue: 8,0:09:28.54,0:09:31.14,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}２回目も ああなんかな
Dialogue: 8,0:09:38.58,0:09:42.30,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}こっちは水浸しで ステージが変更になって大変
Dialogue: 8,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.12,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お客さんも少なくて
Dialogue: 8,0:09:45.92,0:09:46.82,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そっちは
Dialogue: 8,0:09:46.96,0:09:47.92,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.20,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}大変だね
Dialogue: 8,0:09:50.20,0:09:54.42,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}こっちはね、サイン会で使うCDが届いてないんだ！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.00,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}渋滞なんだって
Dialogue: 8,0:09:58.24,0:10:02.34,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}｢ＣＤが届くまでステージで 何かしないといけないの｣
Dialogue: 8,0:10:02.34,0:10:05.82,A-美也,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}茜ちゃんクイズとか 茜ちゃん大喜利とか
Dialogue: 8,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.80,A-美也,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}茜ちゃん人狼は どうでしょう
Dialogue: 8,0:10:08.80,0:10:12.32,A-茜,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あの… 茜ちゃん大活躍でうれしいけど
Dialogue: 8,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.68,A-茜,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}美也ちゃんも活躍してくれていいんだよ？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.44,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まぁ みんな
Dialogue: 8,0:10:20.44,0:10:25.04,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}気持ちを入れ替えて ２回目も私たちなりに精一杯やりましょう！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.46,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうですわね
Dialogue: 8,0:10:26.46,0:10:29.10,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}下を向いていても始まりませんし
Dialogue: 8,0:10:29.10,0:10:31.40,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも オーディエンスが…
Dialogue: 8,0:10:31.40,0:10:35.68,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お客さんがいないのは 新人アイドルちゃんによくあることなんです
Dialogue: 8,0:10:37.60,0:10:39.04,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}やっぱり…
Dialogue: 8,0:10:39.04,0:10:41.62,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そんなに うまくいかないよね
Dialogue: 8,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.63,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみお姉さんに任せなさい！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:53.88,0:10:56.01,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}プロデューサーは心配しないで
Dialogue: 8,0:11:13.58,0:11:16.54,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさん 聞きました お客さんの入り
Dialogue: 8,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.38,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}育が桃子から聞いて
Dialogue: 8,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.74,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そ… そうだったの
Dialogue: 8,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.33,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}大丈夫ですか？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.76,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}え… ええ そうね
Dialogue: 8,0:11:24.76,0:11:25.64,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんなは今…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:25.64,0:11:28.20,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あぁ みんなもですけど そうじゃなくて
Dialogue: 8,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.62,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさんのことです
Dialogue: 8,0:11:30.90,0:11:33.90,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}俺が つい頼って 甘えちゃって
Dialogue: 8,0:11:34.82,0:11:36.74,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさん 今きっと
Dialogue: 8,0:11:36.74,0:11:39.52,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}絶対いろんなことを考えてくれてますよね
Dialogue: 8,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.44,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも 何でも言ってください
Dialogue: 8,0:11:43.44,0:11:45.12,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それは俺の役目なんで
Dialogue: 8,0:11:46.28,0:11:48.46,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}頼りないかもしれないですけど
Dialogue: 8,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.44,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}プロデューサーは俺で
Dialogue: 8,0:11:50.44,0:11:54.44,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさんは… ステージで輝く アイドルなんですから
Dialogue: 8,0:12:04.48,0:12:05.40,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさん？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.98,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ありがとうね プロデューサー
Dialogue: 8,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.68,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}声が聞けて よかったわ
Dialogue: 8,0:12:11.64,0:12:12.64,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}こっちは…
Dialogue: 8,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.84,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私は本当に
Dialogue: 8,0:12:15.44,0:12:16.84,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}もう大丈夫！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:24.66,0:12:26.80,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}また勇気をもらっちゃった
Dialogue: 8,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.72,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}スカウトしてもらったときみたいに
Dialogue: 8,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.96,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}目に浮かんだんです
Dialogue: 8,0:12:32.96,0:12:37.44,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ステージで 拍手を浴びて輝く このみさんの姿が
Dialogue: 8,0:12:39.32,0:12:42.88,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あのとき プロデューサーがああ言ってくれたから
Dialogue: 8,0:12:43.62,0:12:46.98,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}輝く私を 私も見たくなった
Dialogue: 8,0:12:47.60,0:12:50.14,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}変われるんじゃないかって思った
Dialogue: 8,0:12:51.06,0:12:52.42,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それに今は
Dialogue: 8,0:12:53.06,0:12:55.08,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私だけじゃない
Dialogue: 8,0:12:55.08,0:12:57.38,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんなでなら きっと変われる
Dialogue: 8,0:12:58.38,0:12:59.30,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}だから
Dialogue: 8,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.98,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんなで輝きたいの！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:04.69,0:13:06.17,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさん？
Dialogue: 8,0:13:06.17,0:13:10.11,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}デビューは 私たちのアイドルとしての第一歩
Dialogue: 8,0:13:10.11,0:13:13.20,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これから始まるシアター公演の第一歩よ
Dialogue: 8,0:13:13.65,0:13:15.97,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今日が どんな公演になったとしても
Dialogue: 8,0:13:15.97,0:13:20.73,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}やったこと全部 これからのシアター公演につながっていくんだもの
Dialogue: 8,0:13:20.73,0:13:23.58,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}諦めるのはまだ早いと思わない？
Dialogue: 8,0:13:24.39,0:13:25.57,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}せやな
Dialogue: 8,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.45,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まだなんも終わってへんし
Dialogue: 8,0:13:27.45,0:13:29.55,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}むしろ始まったばかりですものね
Dialogue: 8,0:13:29.55,0:13:30.50,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.63,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみ さすがリーダーです！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:32.97,0:13:34.06,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私ね
Dialogue: 8,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.86,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}プロデューサーにアイドルにならないかって言われたとき
Dialogue: 8,0:13:38.54,0:13:41.58,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私も変われるんじゃないかって思ったの
Dialogue: 8,0:13:41.97,0:13:47.49,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それから プレオープンイベントとか デビューした他のチームを見てね
Dialogue: 8,0:13:47.49,0:13:51.21,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ホントにみんな こんなに変われるんだなって
Dialogue: 8,0:13:51.21,0:13:54.24,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}だから私たちも 今がチャンスなの
Dialogue: 8,0:13:54.64,0:13:59.04,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}一度ダメでも それを受け止めて頑張れば きっと変われる
Dialogue: 8,0:13:59.04,0:14:00.40,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}輝けるわ！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:02.19,0:14:03.64,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうやんな
Dialogue: 8,0:14:03.64,0:14:07.93,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私 前に765PRO ALLSTARSのバックダンサーやってんけど
Dialogue: 8,0:14:07.93,0:14:11.88,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ALLSTARSのみんなは どんなことがあっても乗り越えとった
Dialogue: 8,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.87,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それ見て思ってん！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:13.87,0:14:16.54,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私も あんなふうになりたいって
Dialogue: 8,0:14:16.92,0:14:19.72,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}亜利沙の見てきたアイドルちゃんたちは
Dialogue: 8,0:14:19.72,0:14:22.97,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんな どんなときでも頑張って笑顔をくれるんです
Dialogue: 8,0:14:22.97,0:14:27.44,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私たちも 最後まで力を尽くさなくてはいけませんわね
Dialogue: 8,0:14:27.81,0:14:31.55,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}セレブとして このまま諦めるわけには まいりませんわ
Dialogue: 8,0:14:31.90,0:14:34.42,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}キャンバスのアートと同じですね
Dialogue: 8,0:14:34.42,0:14:38.22,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}何度もトライしないと イメージに近づけませんから
Dialogue: 8,0:14:40.02,0:14:41.42,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうだよね
Dialogue: 8,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.54,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子だって…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.98,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子も頑張るよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.41,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ええ！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:56.41,0:14:58.67,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それじゃあみんなで考えましょう！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:58.67,0:15:01.75,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}次のステージを成功させるための方法を！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:01.75,0:15:02.53,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.43,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}考えな あかんのは…
Dialogue: 8,0:15:04.43,0:15:07.02,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お客さんをどうやって集めるかと
Dialogue: 8,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.60,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ステージで何をするかですわね
Dialogue: 8,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.40,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}何すればええんやろうなぁ
Dialogue: 8,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.84,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あ… あの！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:19.49,0:15:22.68,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これは 桃子ちゃんがイヤじゃなかったらなんですけど
Dialogue: 8,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.79,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いいアイデアだと思います！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:25.79,0:15:28.36,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}遊園地側と話をつけておきますね
Dialogue: 8,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.08,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ええ ありがとう！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:31.14,0:15:35.09,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}借りてきたわ これで一気に台本 作っちゃうわよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:35.09,0:15:37.51,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}衣装は ロコに任せてください！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:37.51,0:15:38.29,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ロコちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.35,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}大道具もお願いしていいですか？
Dialogue: 8,0:15:40.35,0:15:42.05,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}オフコースです！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.67,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あとは これも使えます！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.43,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}も？
Dialogue: 8,0:15:47.47,0:15:50.78,P-育,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}５thのみんなで すっごく頑張ったよ
Dialogue: 8,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.57,P-纱代子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}スペシャルじゃんけん大会
Dialogue: 8,0:15:53.57,0:15:56.05,P-纱代子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}思いっきり盛り上がっていきましょう！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.52,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お～っ！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.85,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}フィフス盛り上がってるやん！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:59.85,0:16:02.06,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子たちも負けてられないよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:02.06,0:16:05.11,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうね みんな いくわよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.50,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お～っ！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:06.90,0:16:09.97,其它,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}まもなく ドリームエリア奥ステージにて
Dialogue: 8,0:16:09.97,0:16:14.47,其它,,0,0,20,,{\an8\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}アイドルグループ MILLIONSTARS team4thの定期公演を行ないます
Dialogue: 8,0:16:11.55,0:16:14.47,F-千鹤,,0,600,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}キャーッ！ 大変ですわ！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:12.73,0:16:14.47,其它,,600,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}なんだ
Dialogue: 8,0:16:14.47,0:16:15.83,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どうしたんですか!?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:15.83,0:16:19.27,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私 通りすがりのセレブなのですけれど！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.63,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}通りすがりのセレブ？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:21.63,0:16:25.27,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}実家の大豪邸から持ってまいりました宝物が
Dialogue: 8,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.79,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}何者かに盗まれてしまいましたの
Dialogue: 8,0:16:28.69,0:16:30.39,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}その宝物とは
Dialogue: 8,0:16:30.39,0:16:31.95,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}黄金のコロッケ！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:31.95,0:16:34.27,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ 黄金のコロッケ!?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:34.27,0:16:34.99,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}コロちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.37,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ロコです！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.36,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どんな宝物なんですか!?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:38.97,0:16:40.48,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}黄金のコロッケは
Dialogue: 8,0:16:40.48,0:16:42.44,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お宝中のお宝！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:42.44,0:16:45.32,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}外はサクサク 中はホクホク！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:45.72,0:16:47.11,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}それは普通の…
Dialogue: 8,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.15,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}トラディショナルなコロッケです
Dialogue: 8,0:16:49.57,0:16:50.69,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いえ
Dialogue: 8,0:16:50.69,0:16:54.99,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}セレブだけに その中にダイヤモンドが隠してあるのですわ！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:54.99,0:16:55.77,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}え～っ!?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:55.77,0:16:57.21,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ハイバリューです！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:57.21,0:16:59.68,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}犯人は きっと まだ この近くに！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:00.03,0:17:02.31,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あの 怪しい人見ませんでしたか!?
Dialogue: 8,0:17:02.31,0:17:02.67,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:02.67,0:17:03.57,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}見てない？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:03.57,0:17:04.75,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}怪しい人？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:04.75,0:17:05.67,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どうです？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:05.67,0:17:06.09,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}さあ？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:06.09,0:17:07.43,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}コロッケ持った人とか！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:07.43,0:17:08.47,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}何それ？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:08.47,0:17:09.80,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}見ませんでしたか？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:11.55,0:17:14.24,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ 黄金のコロッケですわ！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:14.24,0:17:15.89,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}犯人です！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:16.36,0:17:17.89,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}フッフッフッ
Dialogue: 8,0:17:17.89,0:17:20.48,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}こうも たやすくバレてしまうとはな
Dialogue: 8,0:17:21.00,0:17:24.52,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\move(960,1060,583,1060,2544,2744)\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私は その名も腹ペコ怪盗奈緒
Dialogue: 8,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.11,P-奈绪,,0,600,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}捕まらへんで！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:26.55,0:17:27.99,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お待ちなさ～い！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:27.99,0:17:30.53,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}エブリワン 一緒に追いかけましょう！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.57,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いこうよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.45,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.07,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ハラペコ怪盗
Dialogue: 8,0:17:34.07,0:17:35.35,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}待ってくださ～い！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:35.35,0:17:38.12,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}皆さんも お手伝いくださ～い！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:38.69,0:17:39.60,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}なんだ？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:39.60,0:17:41.17,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}なんか出し物か？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.24,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}なになに？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:42.24,0:17:44.04,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ちょっとついてってみようか！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.59,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}なんか おもしろそう！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.67,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}きっと この廃屋に逃げたんです！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:54.67,0:17:56.35,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}フッフッフー！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:57.31,0:17:58.91,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ この声は！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.03,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}どこにおるかわからんやろ！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.87,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}やはり この近くに！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:02.87,0:18:04.97,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも どこにも見当たりませんよ!?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:04.97,0:18:06.77,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ロコたちだけではミッション
Dialogue: 8,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.71,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}インポッシブルです！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:09.23,0:18:11.19,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}話は聞かせてもらったよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:11.71,0:18:12.89,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}誰です!?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.17,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あなたは!?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:21.91,0:18:24.29,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あれ 子役探偵 桃子ちゃん？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.35,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}前にやってたドラマのやつ？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:26.35,0:18:27.28,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}違うよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:28.15,0:18:30.16,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今の桃子はアイドル
Dialogue: 8,0:18:30.16,0:18:32.48,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも ただのアイドルじゃない！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.89,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\move(960,1060,520,1060,1468,1668)\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}アイドル探偵！桃子ちゃん
Dialogue: 8,0:18:37.89,0:18:39.55,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}アイドル探偵
Dialogue: 8,0:18:39.55,0:18:40.69,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃん!?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:41.57,0:18:43.18,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子ちゃんだ！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:43.91,0:18:47.82,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}この事件 桃子が来たからには一瞬で解決しちゃうよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:48.37,0:18:51.23,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも 犯人が消えてしまいましたわ
Dialogue: 8,0:18:51.23,0:18:54.47,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ううん 犯人は あそこ！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:54.95,0:18:57.37,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}さては あのロコアートの中に!?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:06.77,0:19:09.47,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}う～ん でも さすがにここには いないかな
Dialogue: 8,0:19:09.47,0:19:10.43,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}確かに
Dialogue: 8,0:19:10.43,0:19:12.31,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}分かりやすすぎますわね
Dialogue: 8,0:19:12.31,0:19:13.34,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい
Dialogue: 8,0:19:14.39,0:19:16.13,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}って 行くんか～い！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.50,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}いた～！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:18.13,0:19:19.83,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これは渡さへんで！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:19.83,0:19:21.06,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}とうっ！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:21.06,0:19:23.87,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}捕まえられるもんなら捕まえてみぃ！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:23.87,0:19:26.81,F-roco,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あ～っ！エスケープされてしまいます！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.20,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そうはさせないわ！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:28.61,0:19:29.44,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}誰や!?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:30.08,0:19:31.07,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お姉ちゃん！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:31.07,0:19:32.36,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お姉ちゃん!?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.44,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}そう 私はアイドル
Dialogue: 8,0:19:35.44,0:19:37.52,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも ただのアイドルじゃない！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:37.81,0:19:41.91,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\move(960,1060,450,1060,1536,1736)\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}セクシー探偵！このみお姉さんよ
Dialogue: 8,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.47,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}セクシー探偵
Dialogue: 8,0:19:43.47,0:19:45.08,F-千鹤,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみお姉さん!?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:45.59,0:19:48.56,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}で ここでこのみさんの登場だね
Dialogue: 8,0:19:48.56,0:19:49.24,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:49.56,0:19:52.92,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ずっとチームのために頑張ってくれてる人の出番です
Dialogue: 8,0:19:54.88,0:19:56.68,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}さあ 覚悟なさい！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:56.68,0:19:58.09,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ぐぬぬ…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:58.09,0:19:59.97,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ありがとう 来てくれて
Dialogue: 8,0:20:00.44,0:20:01.60,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}こちらこそ！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:02.04,0:20:04.40,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}頑張れ アイドル探偵！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.49,其它,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}子役探偵も頑張れ！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.36,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}違います セクシー探偵です！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.32,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お姉ちゃんがいてくれれば百人力だよ
Dialogue: 8,0:20:15.85,0:20:18.17,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ええ！ 何度 逃げても！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:18.17,0:20:20.24,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}何度だって追いかけるんだから！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.89,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}さあ！ダイヤは返してもらうわよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.62,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}な… なにを！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:26.77,0:20:29.57,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あっ そこ 穴あいてるから気をつけて
Dialogue: 8,0:20:29.57,0:20:32.40,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}あぁ ご親切に ありがとうな
Dialogue: 8,0:20:32.96,0:20:35.15,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}って なんでやね～ん！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:35.15,0:20:36.32,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}やったね！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.76,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これにて！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:39.32,0:20:41.33,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}一件落着！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:53.58,0:20:55.22,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}一件落着！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:55.82,0:20:57.02,P-未来,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}わぁ！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.54,A-翼,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}おもしろい！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:58.54,0:21:02.50,F-静香,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ネットでも デビューイベントが同時開催って 話題になってるわよ
Dialogue: 8,0:21:02.94,0:21:05.27,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}みんな 本当に頑張ったな！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:05.27,0:21:07.03,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}めっちゃウケてました！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.87,P-奈绪,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}直接 見られへんくて残念でしたね！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:09.87,0:21:12.54,P-arisa,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}戻って フィフスのイベント映像も見ませんか？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.64,A-女儿,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}はい！みんなで見ましょう！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.44,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}桃子も大活躍だったな
Dialogue: 8,0:21:21.44,0:21:22.28,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ありがとう
Dialogue: 8,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.56,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これくらい普通だもん
Dialogue: 8,0:21:24.56,0:21:28.16,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}でも 次は もっとすごいステージにしてみせるんだから！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:28.68,0:21:30.76,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}これからは見逃し厳禁
Dialogue: 8,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.27,F-桃子,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}瞬き禁止だよ！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:32.27,0:21:33.20,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ああ！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:39.71,0:21:40.66,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}このみさん
Dialogue: 8,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.61,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}ここにいたんですね
Dialogue: 8,0:21:44.10,0:21:46.97,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}うん ちょっと風に当たりたくて
Dialogue: 8,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.74,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}今日は本当にありがとうございました
Dialogue: 8,0:21:50.47,0:21:52.73,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}お礼を言うのは こっちのほう
Dialogue: 8,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.02,S-赤P源P,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}えっ？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:54.73,0:21:55.91,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}プロデューサー
Dialogue: 8,0:21:57.23,0:21:59.77,A-bba,,0,0,20,,{\fnFOT-TsukuGo Pro E\fs60\bord2.5}私をアイドルにしてくれて
